{
  "case_id": "2006-06-219",
  "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners (Garre)",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0000-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Respondent asks this Court to recognize a new constitutional tort under Bivens and the Just Compensation Clause"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0000-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "General Garre, there's a record here that the district court said there was substantial evidence, enough to go to trial, of a pattern of harassing conduct that included trespasses on this man's lodge and leaving the place in disarray, videotaping the guests, selective enforcement of the grazing laws, a whole pattern of things, even asking the Bureau of Indian Affairs to impound his cattle? This man says, this has been done to me by officers of my government. Is there a remedy?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners (Garre)",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0000-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "We don't think that there is a remedy under Bivens or an inferred action under the Just Compensation Clause."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0000-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 5,
        "start": 5
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "May I ask a quick question. I had the same list of alleged acts, and I think many of them are uncontested, that Justice Ginsburg mentioned."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners (Garre)",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0000-0004",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 5,
        "start": 5
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Our position is that he hasn't established a constitutional tort or an actionable claim under RICO."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0001-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Can I ask you about the Bivens theory here before your time runs out? Doesn't Davis versus Passman help the Respondent here?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Garre",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0001-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "I think what is distinct about the Bivens claim here is first Bivens and Just Compensation Clause claims are fundamentally incompatible. And that in Bivens, its damages are nothing. Here the constitutional right actually explicitly provides a remedy, just compensation."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0001-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 28,
        "start": 28
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "ORAL ARGUMENT OF LAURENCE H. TRIBE ON BEHALF OF THE RESPONDENT"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Tribe",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0001-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 39,
        "start": 39
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "It is the retaliatory pattern that there is no remedy for."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0001-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 39,
        "start": 39
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "seem to me that you are asking us to extend Bivens, this is an extension. Would you accept that?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0002-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 43,
        "start": 43
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Mr. Tribe, could I ask a question about the RICO claims?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Souter",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0002-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 52,
        "start": 52
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOUTER: So are you saying that there was therefore no way short of Bivens even to challenge or even to vindicate his claim of selective prosecution."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0002-0007",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 56,
        "start": 56
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "REBUTTAL ARGUMENT OF GREGORY C. GARRE, FOR PETITIONERS"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Garre",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0003-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 59,
        "start": 59
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. GARRE: They don't have a Bivens remedy and they don't have a RICO remedy."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Souter",
      "case_id": "2006-06-219",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "bdd25bdc7683b5f9fda37a01287db67117827e8db61343b1b69c5f2abdde6dc6",
      "evidence_id": "ev-bdd25bdc7683-0003-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 60,
        "start": 60
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOUTER: Why is that a reasonable assumption in response to their argument?"
    },
    {
